      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOLLIES HAYLEY (8) had the drop on the lead early on but could only manage second, beaten 3.5 lengths (23.26) at The Gardens in a Grade 5 over 400m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Makes plenty of appeal. BIG CUTIE (2) produced a moderate performance last time when seventh at this track over 300m behind Amazing Bundy (17.96) in a Grade 4. Comes through a solid form race last start. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. SPITFIRE GEORGE (1) turned in a moderate effort last time when sixth at this track over 300m behind Barrelled (18.09) in a Grade 5. Is yet to taste defeat in two starts from this draw. Cannot be underestimated. TRALEE TINY (7) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
